@startuml
title Authorised Module Context Snapshot
actor Lecturer
participant UI
participant "Context API" as API
participant "Authorization Service" as Auth
database PostgreSQL as DB
Lecturer -> UI: Open module selector
UI -> API: GET /teaching-contexts
API -> Auth: active tenant/role/scope
Auth -> DB: assignments and organisation scope
DB --> API: authorised offerings only
API --> UI: module options
Lecturer -> UI: Select offering and send prompt
UI -> API: module_offering_id
API -> DB: resolve module, period, outcomes, programmes
API -> DB: append immutable module_context_snapshot
@enduml
